    "physical_description": "Cover of embroidered linen with silks. Made from six vertical strips of linen and embroidered in shades of rust, red, pink, green, brown and orange. Chain stitch and bokhara couching.\r\n\r\nThe main border is decorated with a series of large round-headed flowers, each decorated with a different pattern, and linked by curving leafy stems bearing smaller flowers. The two subsidiary borders on either side contain continuous scrolling stems bearing leaves and flowers which sit within the curves on alternate sides of the stems.\r\n\r\nThe centre of the hanging is plain except for two groups of large flowers, encircled by leafy stems, which fill the spandrels of the pointed arch at the top. Lined with plain cotton.",
